   "Los datos de 2025 son provisionales."
  ],
  "en": [
   "In purchasing power standards (PPS): corrects for differences in price levels between countries, so that a euro buys the same everywhere.",
   "In Ireland and Luxembourg, GDP per person is inflated by multinational profits and by workers who live in other countries.",
   "2025 data are provisional."
  ]
